#: ../../source/users/schema/element/element_add.rst:5
msgid "Add element"
msgstr "添加元件"

#: ../../source/users/schema/element/element_add.rst:7
msgid "To add an `element`_ to the `workspace`_:"
msgstr "要将 `元件 <element_>`_ 添加到 `工作区 <workspace_>`_ 中："

#: ../../source/users/schema/element/element_add.rst:9
msgid ""
"Select `auto numbering pattern`_ at the `Auto numbering selection panel`_."
msgstr ""
"在 `自动编号选择面板 <Auto numbering selection panel_>`_ 中选择 `自动编号模式 <auto numbering "
"pattern_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/element/element_add.rst:14
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech Auto numbering selection panel"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 自动编号选择面板"

#: ../../source/users/schema/element/element_add.rst:18
msgid ""
"If the `Auto numbering selection panel`_ is not displayed, it can be "
"displayed from **Settings > Display > Auto numbering selection**."
msgstr ""
"如果 `自动编号选择面板 <Auto numbering selection panel_>`_ 未显示，可通过 **设置 > 显示 > "
"自动编号选择** 将其显示出来。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/element/element_add.rst:21
msgid "Search the `element`_ at the collection panel."
msgstr "在集合面板中搜索 `元件 <element_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/element/element_add.rst:22
msgid ""
"Left Click on the desired `element`_. Without releasing move the mouse to "
"the `workspace`_ area, once the mouse is at the `workspace`_ it can be "
"released."
msgstr ""
"左键单击所需的 `元件 <element_>`_ 。不要松开鼠标，将鼠标移动到 `工作区 <workspace_>`_ 区域，当鼠标位于 `工作区 "
"<workspace_>`_ 时即可松开。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/element/element_add.rst:23
msgid ""
"Search for the desired element position and left click on the place to add "
"the `element`_, multiples `elements`_ can be added with multiple clicks at "
"different places."
msgstr ""
"找到所需的元件位置，左键单击该位置即可添加 `元件 <element_>`_ ，在不同位置多次单击可添加多个 `元件 <elements_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/element/element_add.rst:24
msgid "Press ``esc`` to finish the adding action."
msgstr "按 ``esc`` 结束添加操作。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/element/element_add.rst:28
msgid ""
"Select **Settings > Display > Collections** menu item to display the "
"collections panel."
msgstr "选择 **设置 > 显示 > 集合** 菜单项以显示集合面板。"
